# Generated fixture repositories + per-run sandboxes. Everything under here is
# reproducible from a FixtureSpec (`vs-reference fixtures build`), so it is never
# tracked.
# No trailing slash: on a machine where these are symlinked off a synced
# volume (iCloud eviction mid-measure is real), a `dir/` pattern would not
# match the link and the link would show up as untracked.
/.fixtures
/.runs

# This package is its own workspace root, so it has its own build directory
# (the repo-root .gitignore's `/target` is root-anchored and does not cover it).
/target
